# omarchy: Ryzen 7 8700G (8 cores, 16 threads), 30 GiB, x86. Same columns as runner/repos.
# 2026-10-12: Garrett chose to share omarchy again. myqap keeps 4 slots, so the 4 jobs of a myqap
# run can start together while omarchy has room, with 2 CPUs each. Bison Brain gets 3 slots, because its CI waited up to
# 40 min for a Mac slot. The two VMs take 22 GiB and leave 8 GiB for the desktop.
garrettyarmo/myqap 4 8 10
# Bison Brain's deploy-staging builds linux/arm64 images, so it pins ARM64 (bisonbrain PR 673).
# 2026-10-15: 2 slots, so the pool total is 4 (bisonbrain issue 766). With 3 slots, the VM ran out of memory and CI Postgres shut down.
garrettyarmo/bisonbrain 2 10 12
